UART - Universal Asynchronous Reciever/Transmitter
way for 2 devices to communicate
1 bit at a time, across 2 wires
both sides agree in advanced on the speed AKA Baude Rate
both timekeep independently
-------------------------Typical UART FRAME--------------------------------
IDLE → START BIT → DATA BITS (e.g. 8) → [PARITY BIT] → STOP BIT(S) → IDLE

